HST Office: contextual ribbon tabs as in Office.

Selecting a table, picture, chart or shape shows its tabs and leaves the ribbon on the current tab; view modes such as
print preview still open theirs. Table Design and Table Layout, Picture Format, Shape Format, Chart Design and Chart
Format. A selected chart reports the Chart context in all three applications, and the commands of the chart tabs reach
the frame of the chart through a dispatch interceptor. Calc gets Table Design for its database tables.

